    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Sans Vilmos Zsigmond (disparu le 1er janvier 2016), le cin\u00e9ma am\u00e9ricain des ann\u00e9es soixante-dix ne serait pas le m\u00eame. Invit\u00e9 \u00e0 Paris en 2014 pour \u00e9voquer sa carri\u00e8re, ce mythique chef op\u00e9rateur accepte de passer devant la cam\u00e9ra pour une rencontre d\u2019un autre type.",
        "english": "Without Close Encounters with Vilmos Zsigmond (who died on January 1, 2016), 1970s American cinema would not have been the same. Invited to Paris in 2014 to talk about his career, this mythical cameraman accepted to stand on the other side of the camera for a close encounter of another sort."
    },
